    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares have invaded everyone's dreams, and those in distress will enter an endless cycle of nightmare devastation. Only players can delve into dreams, use cards to build dream cities, summon dream creatures, and fight for every victory in resisting nightmares. When players embark on the path of rescue, the unlocked new cards and abilities will help them resist nightmares</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the power of dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of randomly generated cards to build cities. Only by balancing management and combat can one have the ability to resist the attack of nightmares. Would you choose to fight with elite troops or rely on a battle of numbers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.poster.avif?t=1753551029\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.webm?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.mp4?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layout starts from architecture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reasonably arranging buildings and grouping them together or in close proximity may lead you to discover different buildings, which may become more dangerous, but opportunities always come with risks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge equipment, select the most suitable equipment for living beings, and enhance their strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.poster.avif?t=1753551029\" width=570 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.webm?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.mp4?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Harvest of Dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every confrontation can yield rewards, and the enhanced strength will be a powerful support for the next confrontation</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares have invaded everyone's dreams, and those in distress will enter an endless cycle of nightmare devastation. Only players can delve into dreams, use cards to build dream cities, summon dream creatures, and fight for every victory in resisting nightmares. When players embark on the path of rescue, the unlocked new cards and abilities will help them resist nightmares</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the power of dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of randomly generated cards to build cities. Only by balancing management and combat can one have the ability to resist the attack of nightmares. Would you choose to fight with elite troops or rely on a battle of numbers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.poster.avif?t=1753551029\" width=800 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.webm?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/5db39aaa7f738ce88d19bc65037bb86c.mp4?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Layout starts from architecture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reasonably arranging buildings and grouping them together or in close proximity may lead you to discover different buildings, which may become more dangerous, but opportunities always come with risks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge equipment, select the most suitable equipment for living beings, and enhance their strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.poster.avif?t=1753551029\" width=570 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.webm?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730110/extras/86acc8b33a90c082178abd04358b60b8.mp4?t=1753551029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Harvest of Dreams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every confrontation can yield rewards, and the enhanced strength will be a powerful support for the next confrontation</p>",
